@startuml AnySpark v4 - Sequence: 约束机制（S83）
!theme plain
title AnySpark v4 — 顺序图：约束注入（全局 + 当前情景实体子集）
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor User
participant "routes_settings\n/routes_settings" as S
participant "WorldSettingStore\n/align.worldsettings" as WS
participant "agent_factory\n/agent_factory" as AF
participant "GraphStore\n/graph.schema" as GS
participant "Agent 循环\n/core.loop" as Agent
participant "routes_explore\n/routes_explore" as EX
participant "探索引擎\n/explore" as Exp

== 约束写入（人工 / 提炼） ==
User -> S: POST /api/settings（is_constraint=1, entities=雾城）
S -> WS: add(is_constraint, entities)
User -> S: POST /api/settings（is_constraint=1, 无 entities=全局约束）

== 写作注入（当前时空点实体子集） ==
User -> Agent: 写涉及雾城的章节
Agent -> AF: make_agent → 注入块装配
AF -> WS: list_constraints(book_id)
AF -> GS: known_facts（当前时空点实体：雾城…）
AF -> AF: render_constraints_block（全局 + 与情景实体交集）
AF --> Agent: 注入块「作品约束（必须遵守的规则）」

== 探索注入（情景描述实体子集） ==
User -> EX: POST /api/explore/path（from=雾城钟表铺）
EX -> WS: list_constraints + constraint_texts（from/to 提及实体）
EX -> Exp: explore_path(constraints=全局+雾城相关+临时)
@enduml
